  "id": "cranberry-salad",
  "name": "Cranberry Salad",
  "subtitle": "A chilled cranberry, pineapple, and marshmallow salad",
  "description": "Ground cranberries are sweetened, chilled, and folded with pineapple, marshmallows, pecans, and whipped cream for a cool, lightly textured salad.",
